use firn/tags
use firn/responsibilities

requirements for I1
  ?module is enabled on ?host by ?tag requires ?host enables ?tag

requirements for I2
  every ?module, ?host where ?module is enabled on ?host: ?module is supported on ?host
  ?module is tag-enabled on ?host requires ?module is supported on ?host

requirements for I3
  ?host gets ?path set to ?value by ?module requires ?module is enabled on ?host by default through ?_

requirements for I4
  ?host enables ?module for environment software ?software requires ?module is enabled on ?host
  ?host starts ?software as a long-lived system service for ?responsibility requires ?_ is enabled on ?host
